Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there. You will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.30,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,790)}Enter: Tony Tony Chopper
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.30,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(720,790)}Enter: Tony Tony Chopper
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you've got it backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hiding thing, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a little late at this\Npoint, And I can still see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and can you tell me\Nhow your fever's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's choking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it down, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.56,0:02:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fever seems to have\Ngone down a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's gone down several degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only doctor\Naround here. Dr. Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can call me Dr. Rain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then that means we're on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for how I stay so young?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, yes, you're in the\Ncastle on the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, there were two other people\Nwho showed up here with me, weren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're sleeping in the next room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.61,0:03:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two real tough guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what caused your sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were bitten by a\Nbug called the kestia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a poisonous tick that thrives in\Njungles with high heat and humidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it bites you, it introduces\Na type of bacteria into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bacteria lay dormant for\Nfive days, causing severe pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It causes a high fever,\Na severe infection,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,myocarditis, and arteritis, not pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the infection's\Nprogression in the affected area,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd guess you'd been infected\Nfor about three days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.62,0:04:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain you'd been feeling\Nmust have been terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but still it would have eased up in two\Nmore days without any treatment at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have gone away\Nin two days? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be feeling any pain\Nwhatsoever because you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This particular infection is\Nknown as the five-day disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had heard that Kestia had died\Nout over a hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I kept the antibiotic just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you guys come from that\Nyou may have been exposed to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you walking around some ancient\Njungle with your belly showing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this situation sound familiar at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a crazy girl you are, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treatment for the disease\Nisn't completely finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine as long\Nas my fever goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body will take care\Nof itself after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you an optimistic one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This disease normally takes a course of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,treatment ten days long\Nto successfully cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:05:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with medicines as\Nadvanced as mine are,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your body will still\Nneed at least three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to fully recuperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to risk more suffering\Nand possibly death, get some rest, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get Vivi home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a patient leaves this castle, it's\Nbecause she's either cured or deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't going anywhere, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He climbed this mountain\Nwith his bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's almost three miles\Nof sheer rock to go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:06:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His entire body is on\Nthe brink of frostbite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking dressing\Nlike that for such a climb?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Draw some hot water and throw him into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is bleeding a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has six broken ribs\Nand a spinal fissure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I operate on him, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently the most critical of\Nour three patients is this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, have phenocall, cardiotonic,\Nand thiosaline ready for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has an infection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the infection isn't\Nfrom anywhere on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make the bleeding kid\Nand the sick girl better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can rest easy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save them, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, let's begin treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A renaissance stew should\Nbe simmered in a large pot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for three hours until all\Nthe meat becomes tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Venison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me cook this guy up first!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you're all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting there, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One tasty venison dish for Nami coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.32,0:08:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are already up and moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me about this talking deer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figured you'd ask about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run away, meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat it yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a reindeer with\Na blue nose, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But normal reindeers don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's different from ordinary\Nreindeers in some way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not food for you, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's different, it's just because\Nhe ate a human-human fruit, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human-human fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still a reindeer, but now\Nhe has the abilities of a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like talking and walking abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And also, he's a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I taught Chopper everything that I\Nknow about the field of medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was disappointing, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, that was a good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I told you to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can go over there\Nand look for Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Dig everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they all so worked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it all to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, let's just give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be one of\Nmy crew please old lady
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we really need to have a doctor on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy you did tell me\Nthat's your name isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that right yeah right\Nthat's what i said old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If i were you i'd be a little\Nmore careful of what i say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still well within my youthful 130s\Nthank you jeez you're a tough old head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you boys really asking\Nme to become a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be an incredible\Nwaste of my precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have no interest\Nin life on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are all lame excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about adventure, old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this one's a slow learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I just tell you\Nto watch what you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these guys are pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, food, come back here! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of that, idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In just a few minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to cook you a delicious\Nreindeer dish you'll never forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eat you guys first\Nbefore I let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scary fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about food, I\Njust want some peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that shouldn't be inside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you need to stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you still have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like it's pretty much gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost him, at least for now. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ene's medicine works\Nquickly to reduce the fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the bacteria from\Nthe castia will still
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remain inside your body\Nfor a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just take your antibiotic\Nshot and stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's been\Ntaking care of me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need thanks from you\Nor any other low-life human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind that, I'm just being silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, seriously, I'm being such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not so good at hiding his emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone we found Dalton over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what yeah fantastic we're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible I can't feel a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This castle is really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing and filled with snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the sharpest knife in\Nthe drawer, are you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's snow everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:13:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the doors to the unused\Nrooms are frozen shut too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here in just a moment, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should rethink this idea about\Nasking the old hag to join our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real doctor doesn't\Nchase her patients around
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a freaky snow-filled\Ncastle trying to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you guys are pirates? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates? Real pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have a flag with a skull on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.52,0:14:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're really\Ninterested in pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Not at all! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could come sail with\Nus out on the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you did, that would\Nreally help me out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had a doctor on this ship, then\NI wouldn't have to stay in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three more days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you'd have a really\Ngood time if you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize I'm a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't belong on a ship\Nwith a bunch of humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer, but I walk on two\Nlakes, and I talk and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Animals aren't supposed to\Nbe able to do that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're trying to scare\Nme off, it isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have a blue nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those brats sure can run, can't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't much like what you\Nwere doing there, girl. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to tempt my reindeer away\Nfrom me without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your permission to make\Na move on a man all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I suppose you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to take him\Naway from here, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must warn you, it won't\Nbe as easy as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper has a scar on his heart,\Na deep one my medicine can't cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the moment he was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone, including his parents,\Nturned their backs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because he was born with a blue nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was forced to walk at\Nthe back of the group,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,separated from the rest of the reindeer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though he was just\Na helpless newborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day he ate a Devil Fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he became even more of an\Noutcast than he had been before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other reindeer pressured\Nhim to leave the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His blue nose already made him different,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now he wasn't like the\Nordinary reindeer at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, he was lonely and wanted friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he went down to a village\Nwalking on two legs, as humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is that creature over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even walking on two legs, he\Ndidn't look anything like the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for some reason, his\Nnose was still blue as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.26,0:17:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a Yeti!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the children inside, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring me a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, before he runs\Naway! Get him! Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't know what was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't understand why they reacted to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his appearance with so\Nmuch fear and anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd gone to the village seeking friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they called him a\Nmonster and drove him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was no longer a reindeer,\Nbut he wasn't a human either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was something in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.02,0:18:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so he lived alone after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,caught between two worlds\Nthat wouldn't accept him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've heard his story, do you\Nthink you can heal the scar on his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, check out the door\Nat the front entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wide open. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's so cold in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.54,0:18:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With it open like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's not much difference between\Ninside and outside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that door, get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind him, let's close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or we're gonna freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:18:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.41,0:19:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he so angry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come over here a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bunch of baby snowbirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, if we closed the door, they'd fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the reason\Nthey're leaving it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up a sec. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weird reindeer guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:19:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he speaking earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I remember\Nhim walking on two legs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get this straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He walks upright and talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has fur. He's little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And becomes big.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.20,0:20:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cool guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he should join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything as\Nlong as you are with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown stronger having you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've started on an everlasting ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible when your love is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you I have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far we can make this go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.66,0:21:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just right, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the distance, glistening like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the sun rises in the dark.

